+---
+id: task-004-add-bulk-task-import-helper
+type: task
+title: "Add bulk task import helper"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Export a public `importTasks(list, text)` helper from `src/index.ts`. Parse one task per line in
+`title;priority;tags` format, with optional empty priority and space separated tags. Skip blank
+lines. Add valid tasks to the given list and return counts of imported tasks plus rejected lines
+with one-based line numbers and reasons.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Valid lines create tasks through the supplied list; omitted priority uses the list's normal default.
+- Blank lines are skipped and do not count as rejected.
+- Malformed or invalid lines are reported as `{ line, reason }` without stopping later imports.
+- Return `{ imported, rejected }` with rejected line numbers counted from 1.
+- The helper and appropriate public result types are exported from `src/index.ts`.
